# TestApp UI registry

| Need | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Primitives / atoms | `web/src/kit` |
| App stage / phone chrome | `web/src/App.svelte` |
| Reusable composites | `web/src/components` |
| Screens | `web/src/views` |
| Fixtures / copy | `fixtures/vsa01` |
| Cursor bridge | `services/cursor-bridge` |

Do not hand-grow a second primitive tree. New atoms → kit (later: ui8kit codegen).
